      "created_at": "2013-08-11T19:39:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>According to my calculations (no playtester knowledge, just going off of officially released info) there will be about 30 heroes, 36 villains, and 18 environments. This is enough to fit into 2 EE-sized boxes, unless you are sleeving them, like I am. In that case it will take an extra box, with about half of the third box left over. Fortunately, the final expansion is (probably) slated to be another mega-expansion like Vengeance, meaning that I'll have enough room for my cards without having to buy extra boxes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(If that wasn't your plan... hopefully you're up for negotiation?)</p>",
